                "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Outfit,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:40px;padding:28px;background:#F0F4FF;border-radius:20px;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;margin:0 0 20px;\">What You'll Learn</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#2563EB;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10003;</span>Complete digital marketing strategy</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#2563EB;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10003;</span>SEO &amp; content marketing mastery</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#2563EB;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10003;</span>Google Ads &amp; Facebook Ads</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#2563EB;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10003;</span>Social media management</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#2563EB;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10003;</span>Email marketing automation</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#2563EB;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">&#10003;</span>Analytics &amp; reporting</div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:40px;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;margin:0 0 20px;\">Course Curriculum</h2><div style=\"border:1.5px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\"><div style=\"padding:18px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#F9FAFB;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;font-size:15px;\">Module 1: Digital Marketing Fundamentals</span><span style=\"margin-left:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;\">5 lessons &middot; 3 hours</span></div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6B7280;font-weight:700;\">&#8722;</span></div><div style=\"padding:16px 20px;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;\"><div>&#128249; Introduction to Digital Marketing</div><div>&#128249; The Digital Marketing Ecosystem</div><div>&#128249; Setting Marketing Goals &amp; KPIs</div><div>&#128196; Customer Journey Mapping</div><div>&#9989; Module 1 Quiz</div></div></div></div><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\"><div style=\"padding:18px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;font-size:15px;\">Module 2: SEO Mastery</span><span style=\"margin-left:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;\">6 lessons &middot; 4 hours</span></div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6B7280;font-weight:700;\">+</span></div></div><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\"><div style=\"padding:18px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;font-size:15px;\">Module 3: Google Ads &amp; Paid Search</span><span style=\"margin-left:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;\">5 lessons &middot; 3.5 hours</span></div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6B7280;font-weight:700;\">+</span></div></div><div><div style=\"padding:18px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;font-size:15px;\">Module 4: Social Media Strategy</span><span style=\"margin-left:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;\">6 lessons &middot; 4 hours</span></div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6B7280;font-weight:700;\">+</span></div></div></div></div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;margin:0 0 16px;\">Your Instructor</h2><div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px;border:1.5px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:16px;\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/team1/100/100\" style=\"width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;\" /><div><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-bottom:4px;\">Kamal Perera</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7C3AED;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;\">Founder &amp; CEO &middot; Digital Marketing Expert</div><p style=\"color:#6B7280;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">15+ years of international digital marketing experience. Formerly at Google and Meta. Has personally trained over 2,000 students.</p></div></div></div></div>"
